{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/308699-mokole-abomination","id":308699,"title":"Mokole Abomination","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-10T18:44:46-08:00","id":308699,"title":"Mokole Abomination","content":"Is there any validity to this? Its a Wiki so I ask....<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T18:59:23-08:00","id":308716,"title":"","content":"crud....link didn't work ignore it, here we go:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Sobek_(Abomination\" target=\"_blank\">http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Sobek_(Abomination</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T19:00:56-08:00","id":308718,"title":"","content":"Ok for some reason it won't work....which is very very annoying but if you search the wiki, it references a 4th gen Mokole Setite abomination","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T20:34:07-08:00","id":308793,"title":"","content":"Mokole (and Corax, and presumably Apis if they were still alive) can be abominations... for all of the scant few hours there are from Embrace and botched Gnosis roll until dawn. Anyone in the vicinity is advised to avoid the area, since the Mokole in question is going to be in a constant, irrevocable frenzy until sunrise, at which time the undead weresauropsid will burn to a pile of ash. Corax also burn to death at dawn, and the ties which the Apis boasted would likely result in the same end.<br /> <br /> Any vampiric crocodilian creature which doesn't burn to death at sunrise is likely to be a result of crude vampiric shapeshifting. In V:TM terms, one with a high enough rating in Serpentis to get the &quot;divine form&quot; power or whatever it was, which I believe is the eight-dot effect of Serpentis in V20. To Werewolf's sensibilities, it's just another mockery of nature.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T20:36:57-08:00","id":308797,"title":"","content":"Well yea, but I mean this Sobek character from the wiki, is it a real cannon character or is it just something someone on the net cooked up? I own the Mokole breed book and CB20 so I know that this shouldn't happen, that's what threw me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T20:37:44-08:00","id":308798,"title":"","content":"I'm fighting spending the $12 from drivethru just to read about this one character who might exist","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T21:50:02-08:00","id":308831,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CeltSPZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/308699-mokole-abomination?p=308798#post308798\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm fighting spending the $12 from drivethru just to read about this one character who might exist</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HToKXdN_sY0\" data-code=\"HToKXdN_sY0\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/HToKXdN_sY0/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> By which I mean, this character is probably not official.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T01:01:32-08:00","id":308893,"title":"","content":"The Setites (ie, vampires) whisper that it may exist. By the werewolf rules, it doesn't, by some vampire fluff it might because reasons.<br /> <br /> That's pretty much it. If you want to use it for your own chronicle, do so. The Onyx Path canon police are occupied elsewhere at the moment <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T04:02:29-08:00","id":308925,"title":"","content":"Mechanics wise such creature is impossible to last more than one night, so yeah, probably if it exists it's not a Mokole.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T07:13:19-08:00","id":309086,"title":"","content":"Yea, I was thrown but well we know how often White Wolf in the past had &quot;exceptions&quot; to the rule all over the place. It was something that got old for me because other players started treating these exceptions as the normal in their chronicles. I could go on and on about examples I've run into with games but.....maybe that's best for another thread","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T07:26:11-08:00","id":309098,"title":"","content":"There was once a peculiar trend in Polish fandom. Princes owning ghouled Gurahls. What this was, I don't even.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T07:47:22-08:00","id":309114,"title":"","content":"few friends of mine ended up in a game with a mage werewolf pc...... with the other players being typical mages. when I was invited in I chose not to be involved, that level of stuff makes games not fun for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T08:05:02-08:00","id":309123,"title":"","content":"Was this PC's name Sam Haight?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T08:06:58-08:00","id":309128,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/308699-mokole-abomination?p=309098#post309098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There was once a peculiar trend in Polish fandom. Princes owning ghouled Gurahls. What this was, I don't even.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think that it was limited to just Poland. Or to Gurahl, for that matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T08:21:05-08:00","id":309140,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I don't think that it was limited to just Poland. Or to Gurahl, for that matter. </div> </div> </div>Probably not, but damn, that was ridiculous.<br /> <br /> Another, probably common thread elsewhere, was trying to jam every splat into small town with any history to it. Myself, I just put small caern (largest park in the country, natural landmarks with legends accumulated, probably Kinfolk worked as part of local rare plant and animal preservation effort) in my county since that made sense and ruled that probably Vampires don't want to get near lupine territory unless there are desperate enough. W20 would is broad enough game to run in my local setting.<br /> <br /> Reverse example to mine was somebody trying to jam influential Vampiric population in one not too big town along with a powerful caern guarded by Get of Fenris, a chantry of Mages full of Masters and that was somehow supposed to remain in state of balance and peace without crumbling down because of the Get justifiably deciding they won't abide Wyrmspawn in their hood.<br /> <br /> tl/dr: Crossovers should be handled with utmost care.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T14:14:35-08:00","id":309448,"title":"","content":"So I'm thinking I may run Sobek in my chronicle but just have the legends claim he's a Mokole, but stick to the godform level of serpentis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T14:36:51-08:00","id":309464,"title":"","content":"That's a good choice, I think. And since it is 5th Gen at least, it won't fall easily to shapeshifters in direct confrontation as weaker Vampires are wont to. Of course, after they tear through its web of deception and trickery since any Vampire who got to survive for milennia should possess cunning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T14:49:19-08:00","id":309496,"title":"","content":"I'm a big follower of Joss Wedon, every season needs a &quot;big bad&quot; to take down in the end","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T15:44:19-08:00","id":309533,"title":"","content":"Hilariously, the godform gives about the same boost to stats as Crinos form.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T16:20:19-08:00","id":309562,"title":"","content":"That's an added bonus to confusing the players, toss in skin of the adder for using stamina to soak agg (unless godform grants it, I have to recheck my serpentis)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-23T14:48:16-07:00","id":720662,"title":"","content":"I see its a bit late, but the Sobek your mention is from the vampire book &quot;chaining the beast&quot; it refers to the abd'al sobek (yes i know my user name, but thats not the point). They are a cult who follow of of Set's childer Sobek, I this short passage they whisper that he is an abomination, thus explaining why he is the incarnation of the beast. I've cant attached the section here, but if u want it i can sent it to you. Btw how did that campaign you where planing go? sounded interesting <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8810-abd-al-sobek","name":"Abd'Al-Sobek","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8810_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T12:35:52-07:00","id":723968,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CeltSPZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/308699-mokole-abomination?p=309086#post309086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yea, I was thrown but well we know how often White Wolf in the past had &quot;exceptions&quot; to the rule all over the place. It was something that got old for me because other players started treating these exceptions as the normal in their chronicles. I could go on and on about examples I've run into with games but.....maybe that's best for another thread</div> </div> </div> </div>If you would care to make that thread and recount your tales, I would be interested in reading them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1069-archmage-joda","name":"Archmage Joda","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T17:22:18-07:00","id":724559,"title":"","content":"I see the Mokole Abomination's curse as a mystic application of the sunlight (&quot;burn to death at sunrise&quot;), even if he isn't touched by said light.<br /> So, we can simplify it in &quot;when the Sun rise, His rays pass through everything to burn you, damn were-purse&quot;, basically, if the were-vampire is in an area where he could be burn by sunlight if he was in the open, he is burned anyway.<br /> <br /> Now, I read on the Wiki that this Sobek is embraced through rituals by Set himself.<br /> So, there is another chance: we know there is a 9 dots Serpentis power (Pact with Ra) that let a vampire walk in the sun without harm for one day. As Set was (other than a warrior) even apted to magic, I can see him devicing a ritual using this power as a base, then using the ritual only for the sake of making another powerful pawn (someone said &quot;Bane Mummies&quot;?).<br /> Anyway, what I have in mind is a ritual on these lines.<br /> Until the recipient remain in the darkness, not only he don't suffer for the effects of the sunrise (so, don't need &quot;sleep&quot; but will still need to spend a daily BP), but said darkness will engulf him in daytime. Making like, for him, the sun never rise (so, yeah, the mystic power of the ritual make the darkness shield the bearer from the curse of the Sun).<br /> In the end, the key of this ritual is that, until the Mokole show himself (or is shown) to the Sun, the Sun can't do him anything because the Sun can't <u>find</u> him.<br /> A 9th (or maybe 10th) level ritual like this is perfectly useless for every vampire is not a Mokole (as the do-not-sleep-ritual is at best a 4th, 5th level), and you need a suitable bloodmage for the sake of casting it, but nonetheless, I can see it a big horror story (for the Mokole).<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ed6RV6Z.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/515-ryoga84","name":"Ryoga84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T17:54:22-07:00","id":724611,"title":"","content":"Sobek was turned by Set and not in the ordinary way so I'd think it's a possibility. The wiki even says that it was severed from Helios grace by dark magics cast by Set.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4003-kristviljan","name":"Kristviljan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4003_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T18:01:46-07:00","id":724631,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kristviljan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/308699-mokole-abomination?p=724611#post724611\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sobek was turned by Set and not in the ordinary way so I'd think it's a possibility. The wiki even says that it was severed from Helios grace by dark magics cast by Set.</div> </div> </div> </div>Helios's grace doesn't have much to do with it. Given the entry about Sunbane in the breedbook, doing that just causes the Mokole to get seriously de-powered. Gnosis, already existent and a connection to more than just Helios, prevents the embrace.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T21:13:53-07:00","id":743757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/308699-mokole-abomination?p=724631#post724631\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Gnosis, already existent and a connection to more than just Helios, prevents the embrace.</div> </div> </div> </div>This has always been my interpretation of what happens when Mokole and Corax are Embraced. There is, metaphorically, a bit of sunlight within their souls -- frenzying Mokole &quot;abominations&quot; are even called &quot;sun enfleshed&quot; and their presence hurts vampires like sunlight, until they themselves are ash.<br /> <br /> For comparison, look at Black Spiral Dancers. They are thoroughly corrupted by the Wyrm and cut off from Gifts and Rites that require Gaian spirits. And yet, they are still at their core members of a race created by Gaia. Dancing the Spiral doesn't turn them into pseudo-shapeshifters like the Mockery Breeds. It can't fully take Gaia's touch out of them, even when the Wyrm replaces Her as the source of their very Gnosis.<br /> <br /> Also, while Sun-Lost Corax don't get a lot of wordcount in the Breedbook, IIRC there's no rule that they can be Embraced after they &quot;walk&quot; away from Helios.<br /> <br /> I think this may be distinct from the reasons that Nuwisha and Kitsune can't be Embraced. In their cases, Coyote and Bai Mian Xi blessed/arranged them to be immune. But if that blessing isn't as fundamentally innate as something like Gnosis, maybe there's some horrible way to work around it. Although Coyote is a Celestine and Bai Mian Xi is said to have obtained that blessing from Gaia herself, so their blessings are probably tough to crack.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 10-31-2015, 12:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-31T09:33:16-07:00","id":744620,"title":"","content":"Anyone's thoughts on mokole blood causing vampires to want to bask in moon light or my favorite causing torpor? I run with the torpor result in my games (and allow the Setites a rite for mokole and nagah blood to amp themselves up. After all Jyhad (the vampire CCG) even covered it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}